==Battleground==
*5 [[Vlad de Sable]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Vlad de Sable]]s spawn after 0.33 seconds<sup>10f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Count Owlbrow]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Vlad de Sable]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Vlad de Sable]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**20 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**2 [[Sister Lione]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Similarly to [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 12|Floor 12]], almost all the enemies are [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]]. Pretty much any [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-Floating]] units excel here, with special mentions going to [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]], [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]], and [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]]. However, you'll have to be more careful with Fishman, as the Sister Liones, stronger Sa-Bats, and Teacher Bun Bun can easily stunlock him if mistimed. If you're worried about the Relic Doges, bring [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]] as well if you have them.

